      <p align="center"><b>Membership</b></p>
      <p align="center">So you are interested in our guild? If you want to join
      we have a few rules that you need to live up to.</p>
      <p align="center">Here they follow.
      <br>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <p align="center">Would-be recruits need be at least 5 seasons in their studies.&nbsp;</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p align="center">Would-be recruits must post a character biography in "So ya want to be a mercenary...?" on the Discussion Forum of the Hessian Discussion Boards.&nbsp;<br>
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p align="center">Would-be recruits will then be contacted in game for a friendly chat and a signature in blood on the Hessian contract...er...invitation to the guild.&nbsp;<br>
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
      <p align="center"><font size="2">(Not too harsh are they?)</font></p>
